    "body": "## What does this PR do?\n\nInstall cuBLAS 13.8.1 (archive version `13.8.1.7`) in the Megatron Bridge image, matching https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/pull/7685. The final NeMo Framework image inherits this runtime from the Bridge image.\n\n## Changelog\n\n- Download the official CUDA 13 cuBLAS archive for x86_64 or Arm SBSA before building native dependencies.\n- Replace the existing toolkit headers and cuBLAS/cuBLASLt libraries so current linker paths resolve to the updated runtime; retain the archive license and clean up temporary files.\n- Expose `CUBLAS_VERSION` as a build argument and preserve the base image's cuBLAS when `PRESERVE_BASE_RUNTIME=True`.\n- Document the new archive-version argument separately from the framework base image's existing apt-version argument.\n\nVersion metadata: https://developer.download.nvidia.com/compute/cublas/redist/redistrib_13.8.1.json.\n\n## Validation\n\n- [x] `uv run pre-commit run --all-files` in a container.\n- [x] `bash .github/scripts/test_docker_dependency_layers.sh`.\n- [x] Added shell block passes `bash -n`; `git diff --check` and `docker build --check` pass.\n- [x] Built the added layer on NGC PyTorch 26.08 (x86_64): cuBLAS and cuBLASLt report 13.8.1, headers report 13.8.1.7, and a fresh PyTorch process naturally maps both updated libraries.\n- [x] RTX 6000 Ada FP32, FP16, and BF16 matmul checks against CPU double-precision results pass (five iterations per dtype).\n- [x] `PRESERVE_BASE_RUNTIME=True` retains byte-identical base cuBLAS libraries/headers; unsupported architectures fail with an explicit diagnostic.\n- [x] x86_64 and Arm64 CI image builds passed; both logs confirm the `13.8.1.7` CUDA 13 archives were installed before native dependencies.\n- [x] CI import checks, diffusion unit tests, and all three core unit-test shards passed.\n- [x] All 84 L0/L1 functional jobs passed: 52 H100 jobs and 32 GB200 jobs, with no retries or quarantines.\n- [x] [`CICD NeMo` run 36638276385](https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Megatron-Bridge/actions/runs/36638276385) passed on `66b1fa60d67109fe6281faf9443d98401d6f360b`: 102 successful jobs, including both image builds, import checks, all unit-test shards, all 84 L0/L1 functional jobs, and coverage aggregation. All required PR checks are green.\n\n## CI failures deferred\n\nNone.\n",
